  "semantics": [
    "Softmax ignores operation, input dimensions, output batch and output columns. It caches data pointers and uses output rows as signed count. Max scan starts -FLT_MAX, uses signaling comparison and updates only ordered greater values.",
    "Exponent pass reloads source live after the max scan, subtracts the cached maximum and compares signed raw binary32 bits against0x42b00000. Encodings at/above that signed threshold become88. This is VMOV plus integer CMP, not float-to-integer conversion or numeric floating comparison. Positive NaN behavior differs from a numeric clamp.",
    "Actual C expf executes. Sum adds current exponential first and running sum second; output is written immediately. Final pass reloads every output and divides by cached sum. Forward overlaps and NaN operand priority remain native.",
    "Four arithmetic assembly helpers become noinline volatile C add/subtract/multiply/divide. VMLA becomes add(accumulator,rounded_multiply). VMLS becomes add(accumulator,bit-negated rounded product), preserving NaN sign/priority. Signed integer conversion uses explicit int32 tofloat; absolute and negation use sign-bit operations without new FP exceptions.",
    "The existing expf/tanhf table bytes and shared f32 conversion header are unchanged. Runtime unit now contains no inline assembly; no new writable state or imported dependency is added.",
    "Real C getter returns the real C callback. Normal replay explicitly links the newly built math provider before the older source dependency archive. Source replay has no stock mapping or algorithm models. No public RAM normalization is used."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Primitive tests compare actual prior assembly instructions to C, checking raw R0 bits/full FPSCR/saved registers/SP, with no writable sections or imports. They are controlled CPU replay, not stock whole-function execution.",
    "Full math routines compare S0/full FPSCR/public RAM/saved registers/SP/masks. Tanhf reference is prior accepted C source; expf additionally executes stock0x38f08. Cold FPU, timing and physical sensor behavior are untested.",
    "Full routines exclude8192 private stack bytes below incoming SP and caller-clobbered scratch/APSR. C helper calls change private frames/code size and timing; no byte identity is claimed.",
    "The selected free compiler/profile is qualified by tested section/symbol identity. Other compilers must be requalified for FP operand selection and exception ordering.",
    "Other firmware units still contain assembly, including raw ABI/register bridges. This change removes nine expressions from the existing expf/tanhf unit, not all firmware assembly.",
    "Probe dependency archives emit enum-size and executable-stack-note warnings retained in logs. Tested function interfaces use raw integer/float/pointer types, not enums.",
    "Six callback bindings and five parent SpO2 stages remain unresolved.926-unit relocatable composition has73 application and22 boot imports. Final startup, hardware/interrupt/concurrent mutation and complete boot remain unverified."
  ],
